{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>These are the families of the sons of Noah.</b> In this pericah you will find seventy sons: fourteen to Yefet, thirty to Ham, twenty-six to Shem. And they are the heads of families from whom emerged seventy nations, in seventy languages, and the lands they inherited were called by their names — as in 'and he built a city and called the name of the city after the name of his son Chanoch,' and it says: 'they called lands by names.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:48.118438354Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}